289
00:21:03.818 --> 00:21:05.820
\h \h\h\HBELIEVES ALL THE MAJOR COMPONENTS OF THE NEAR DEATH EXPERIENCE \h /h \H\HCAN BE

290
00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:11.820
